<Legal title="Refund Policy" description="Leadschilly's refund and cancellation policy: free 30-day pilot, monthly plans you can cancel anytime, and full refunds for billing mistakes.">
  <h1>Refund and Cancellation Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 25 October 2026</p>

  <p>This policy explains how payments, cancellations and refunds work for Leadschilly. Customers in India are billed by Leadschilly Technologies Private Limited. Customers outside India are billed by Leadschilly LLC, USA.</p>

  <h2>1. Free 30-day pilot and free trial</h2>
  <p>The pilot, and the 14-day trial for businesses that sign up themselves, are free. We don't charge anything during it, so there is nothing to refund. At the end of it you choose whether to start a paid plan. Nothing renews into a paid plan unless you ask for it.</p>

  <h2>2. Monthly plans</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Plans are billed monthly, in advance.</li>
    <li>A monthly payment is not refundable once it has been charged, including for unused days or users.</li>
    <li>You can cancel at any time. Your plan stays active until the end of the month you have paid for, and you won't be charged again.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How to cancel</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:admin@leadschilly.com">admin@leadschilly.com</a> from the account owner's email address, or message us on WhatsApp at 080 6217 8859. We confirm the cancellation by email.</p>

  <h2>4. When we do refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Billing mistakes:</strong> if you are charged twice, charged the wrong amount, or charged after cancelling, we refund the wrong charge in full.</li>
    <li>Tell us within 30 days of the charge. Refunds go back to the original payment method within 7 to 10 working days of our confirmation.</li>
    <li>For customers in India, refunds include the GST paid on the refunded amount.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Charges from other companies</h2>
  <p>WhatsApp message charges are billed to you directly by Meta, and call charges by your calling provider. Leadschilly doesn't collect these, so refunds for them are handled by those providers under their own policies.</p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>Customers in India: Leadschilly Technologies Private Limited, WorkFlo, Ranka Junction, Vijinapura Village, KR Puram Hobli, Bengaluru 560016, Karnataka, India.<br>
  Customers outside India: Leadschilly LLC, 30 N Gould St, Ste #3569, Sheridan, Wyoming 82801, USA.<br>
  Email: <a href="mailto:admin@leadschilly.com">admin@leadschilly.com</a> · WhatsApp: 080 6217 8859</p>
</Legal>
